{"id":"6e9ca7dabeb2d33022a3d200280a906ef5264c29","axis":"silent","repo":"pnpm/pnpm","sha":"6e9ca7dabeb2d33022a3d200280a906ef5264c29","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/remove-update-ecosystem-deps.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@","+---","+\"pacquet\": patch","+---","+","+`pnpm remove` accepts Python and Cargo package specifiers. Recursive and filtered updates include standalone Python and Cargo workspace members. `pnpm update` and `pnpm outdated` match normalized Python names and Cargo aliases."],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cargo_deps/toolchain.rs","lines":["@@ -60,6 +60,28 @@ pub(crate) async fn provision<Reporter: self::Reporter>(","     http_client: &ThrottledClient,","     manifests: &[PathBuf],","     checkout: Option<&Path>,","+) -> Result<()> {","+    provision_for_command::<Reporter>(","+        config,","+        http_client,","+        manifests,","+        checkout,","+        ToolchainLink::Publish,","+    )","+    .await","+}","+","+pub(crate) enum ToolchainLink {","+    Publish,","+    Preserve,","+}","+","+pub(crate) async fn provision_for_command<Reporter: self::Reporter>(","+    config: &Config,","+    http_client: &ThrottledClient,","+    manifests: &[PathBuf],","+    checkout: Option<&Path>,","+    link_in_project: ToolchainLink,"," ) -> Result<()> {","     let Some(checkout) = checkout else { return Ok(()) };","     if !installs_toolchains(config) {","@@ -86,8 +108,13 @@ pub(crate) async fn provision<Reporter: self::Reporter>(","             }","             Err(error) => return Err(error.into()),","         };","-        let dir = file.parent().expect(\"a toolchain file has a parent directory\");","-        link(dir, &toolchain.dir)?;","+        match link_in_project {","+            ToolchainLink::Publish => {","+                let dir = file.parent().expect(\"a toolchain file has a parent directory\");","+                link(dir, &toolchain.dir)?;","+            }","+            ToolchainLink::Preserve => {}","+        }","         PROVISIONED","             .lock()","             .expect(\"the provisioned toolchains are not poisoned\")"],"additions":29,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cargo_manifest.rs","lines":["@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@","+pub(crate) mod remove;"," pub(crate) mod workspace;"," "," pub(crate) use workspace::{"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cargo_manifest/remove.rs","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,224 @@","+mod features;","+","+use super::{","+    spans::{","+        apply_edits,","+        full_line_range,","+        is_explicit_header,","+        is_inline_table,","+    },","+    workspace_dependency_spec,","+};","+use miette::{","+    IntoDiagnostic,","+    Result,","+    WrapErr,","+};","+use pnpm_package_manifest::DependencyGroup;","+use std::{","+    collections::BTreeSet,","+    ops::Range,","+    path::Path,","+};","+use toml::{","+    Spanned,","+    de::{","+        DeTable,","+        DeValue,","+    },","+};","+","+pub(crate) fn remove_dependencies(","+    path: &Path,","+    names: &BTreeSet<String>,","+    group: Option<DependencyGroup>,","+    removed: &mut BTreeSet<String>,","+) -> Result<()> {","+    let original = std::fs::read_to_string(path)","+        .into_diagnostic()","+        .wrap_err_with(|| format!(\"read {}\", path.display()))?;","+    let mut manifest: toml::Table = toml::from_str(&original).into_diagnostic()?;","+    let mut paths = Vec::new();","+    let mut selection = Removal { path, names, group, removed };","+    selection.remove_from(&mut manifest, &[], &mut paths);","+    if let Some(targets) = manifest.get_mut(\"target\").and_then(toml::Value::as_table_mut) {","+        for (target, value) in targets.iter_mut() {","+            if let Some(table) = value.as_table_mut() {","+                selection.remove_from(table, &[\"target\", target], &mut paths);","+            }","+        }","+    }","+    if paths.is_empty() {","+        return Ok(());","+    }","+    features::prune_feature_references(&mut manifest, &mut paths);","+    let updated = render_removal(original, &manifest, paths, path)?;","+    pnpm_fs::write_atomic(path, updated.as_bytes()).into_diagnostic()","+}","+","+fn render_removal(","+    original: String,","+    manifest: &toml::Table,","+    paths: Vec<Vec<String>>,","+    path: &Path,","+) -> Result<String> {","+    let source = DeTable::parse(&original).into_diagnostic()?;","+    let mut edits = Vec::new();","+    for path in paths {","+        declaration_edits(&original, source.get_ref(), manifest, &path, &mut edits);","+    }","+    edits.sort_by_key(|edit| edit.0.start);","+    edits.dedup_by(|left, right| left.0 == right.0);","+    let updated = apply_edits(original, edits);","+    let checked: toml::Table = toml::from_str(&updated).into_diagnostic()?;","+    if !same_declarations(manifest, &checked) {","+        miette::bail!(\"could not preserve the other declarations in {}\", path.display());","+    }","+    Ok(updated)","+}","+","+// Removing the last dotted declaration can also remove its implicit table.","+fn same_declarations(expected: &toml::Table, actual: &toml::Table) -> bool {","+    actual","+        .keys()","+        .all(|key| expected.contains_key(key))","+        && expected","+            .iter()","+            .all(|(key, value)| match (value, actual.get(key)) {","+                (toml::Value::Table(table), Some(toml::Value::Table(other))) => {","+                    same_declarations(table, other)","+                }","+                (toml::Value::Table(table), None) => same_declarations(table, &toml::Table::new()),","+                (_, other) => other == Some(value),","+            })","+}","+","+struct Removal<'a> {","+    path: &'a Path,","+    names: &'a BTreeSet<String>,","+    group: Option<DependencyGroup>,","+    removed: &'a mut BTreeSet<String>,","+}","+","+impl Removal<'_> {","+    fn remove_from(","+        &mut self,","+        parent: &mut toml::Table,","+        prefix: &[&str],","+        paths: &mut Vec<Vec<String>>,","+    ) {","+        for section in [\"dependencies\", \"dev-dependencies\", \"build-dependencies\"] {","+            let Some(entries) = parent.get_mut(section).and_then(toml::Value::as_table_mut) else {","+                continue;","+            };","+            entries.retain(|alias, value| {","+                if !self.selects(alias, value, section) {","+                    return true;","+                }","+                paths.push(","+                    prefix","+                        .iter()","+                        .copied()","+                        .chain([section, alias])","+                        .map(str::to_owned)","+                        .collect(),","+                );","+                false","+            });","+        }","+    }","+","+    fn selects(&mut self, alias: &str, value: &toml::Value, section: &str) -> bool {","+        let flag = |key: &str| {","+            value","+                .get(key)","+                .and_then(toml::Value::as_bool)","+                .unwrap_or(false)","+        };","+        let group = if flag(\"optional\") {","+            DependencyGroup::Optional","+        } else if section == \"dependencies\" {","+            DependencyGroup::Prod","+        } else {","+            DependencyGroup::Dev","+        };","+        if self.group.is_some_and(|selected| selected != group) {","+            return false;","+        }","+        let package = value.get(\"package\").and_then(toml::Value::as_str);","+        let inherited = flag(\"workspace\")","+            .then(|| workspace_dependency_spec(self.path.parent()?, alias, package))","+            .flatten();","+        let name = inherited","+            .as_ref()","+            .map(|spec| spec.package_name.as_str())","+            .or(package)","+            .unwrap_or(alias);","+        let matched = self.names.contains(alias) || self.names.contains(name);","+        if matched {","+            self.removed.extend(","+                [alias, name]","+                    .into_iter()","+                    .filter(|id| self.names.contains(*id))","+                    .map(str::to_owned),","+            );","+        }","+        matched","+    }","+}","+","+fn declaration_edits(","+    text: &str,","+    source: &DeTable<'_>,","+    remaining: &toml::Table,","+    path: &[String],","+    edits: &mut Vec<(Range<usize>, String)>,","+) {","+    let (name, rest) = path.split_first().expect(\"dependency path\");","+    let (key, value) =","+        super::spans::find_entry(source, name).expect(\"source of dependency declaration\");","+    if rest.is_empty() {","+        if let Some(replacement) = remaining.get(name) {","+            edits.push((value.span(), replacement.to_string()));","+        } else {","+            remove_declaration(text, key.span(), value, edits);","+        }","+    } else if is_inline_table(text, &value.span()) {","+        edits.push((value.span(), remaining[name].to_string()));","+    } else {","+        declaration_edits(","+            text,","+            value","+                .get_ref()","+                .as_table()","+                .expect(\"dependency table\"),","+            remaining[name].as_table().expect(\"dependency table\"),","+            rest,","+            edits,","+        );","+    }","+}","+","+fn remove_declaration(","+    text: &str,","+    key: Range<usize>,","+    value: &Spanned<DeValue<'_>>,","+    edits: &mut Vec<(Range<usize>, String)>,","+) {","+    let span = value.span();","+    if let Some(table) = value.get_ref().as_table()","+        && !is_inline_table(text, &span)","+    {","+        if is_explicit_header(text, &span) {","+            edits.push((full_line_range(text, span), String::new()));","+        }","+        for (child, item) in table {","+            remove_declaration(text, child.span(), item, edits);","+        }","+    } else {","+        edits.push((full_line_range(text, key.start..span.end), String::new()));","+    }","+}","+","+#[cfg(test)]","+mod tests;"],"additions":224,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cargo_manifest/remove/features.rs","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,77 @@","+use std::collections::BTreeSet;","+use toml::{","+    Table,","+    Value,","+};","+","+pub(super) fn prune_feature_references(manifest: &mut Table, paths: &mut Vec<Vec<String>>) {","+    let aliases = paths","+        .iter()","+        .filter_map(|path| path.last())","+        .cloned()","+        .collect();","+    let dependencies = FeatureDependencies::remaining(manifest);","+    let Some(features) = manifest.get_mut(\"features\").and_then(Value::as_table_mut) else {","+        return;","+    };","+    let local = features.keys().cloned().collect();","+    for (name, value) in features.iter_mut() {","+        let Some(items) = value.as_array_mut() else { continue };","+        let count = items.len();","+        items.retain(|item| {","+            item.as_str()","+                .is_none_or(|reference| dependencies.keep(reference, &aliases, &local))","+        });","+        if items.len() != count {","+            paths.push(vec![\"features\".to_owned(), name.clone()]);","+        }","+    }","+}","+","+#[derive(Default)]","+struct FeatureDependencies {","+    all: BTreeSet<String>,","+    optional: BTreeSet<String>,","+}","+","+impl FeatureDependencies {","+    fn remaining(manifest: &Table) -> Self {","+        let mut dependencies = Self::default();","+        dependencies.collect(manifest);","+        if let Some(targets) = manifest.get(\"target\").and_then(Value::as_table) {","+            for table in targets.values().filter_map(Value::as_table) {","+                dependencies.collect(table);","+            }","+        }","+        dependencies","+    }","+","+    fn collect(&mut self, table: &Table) {","+        for section in [\"dependencies\", \"dev-dependencies\", \"build-dependencies\"] {","+            let Some(entries) = table.get(section).and_then(Value::as_table) else { continue };","+            for (alias, spec) in entries {","+                self.all.insert(alias.clone());","+                if spec","+                    .get(\"optional\")","+                    .and_then(Value::as_bool)","+                    .unwrap_or(false)","+                {","+                    self.optional.insert(alias.clone());","+                }","+            }","+        }","+    }","+","+    fn keep(&self, reference: &str, aliases: &BTreeSet<String>, local: &BTreeSet<String>) -> bool {","+        let (alias, keep) = if let Some(alias) = reference.strip_prefix(\"dep:\") {","+            (alias, self.optional.contains(alias))","+        } else if let Some((alias, _)) = reference.split_once(\"?/\") {","+            (alias, self.optional.contains(alias))","+        } else if let Some((alias, _)) = reference.split_once('/') {","+            (alias, self.all.contains(alias))","+        } else {","+            (reference, local.contains(reference) || self.optional.contains(reference))","+        };","+        keep || !aliases.contains(alias)","+    }","+}"],"additions":77,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cargo_manifest/remove/tests.rs","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,43 @@","+use super::remove_dependencies;","+use std::collections::BTreeSet;","+","+#[test]","+fn removes_each_shape_of_declaration_and_preserves_unrelated_entries() {","+    let root = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();","+    let path = root.path().join(\"Cargo.toml\");","+    for source in [","+        \"[dependencies]\\nkept='2'\\nold={package='example',version='1'}\",","+        \"[dependencies]\\nold.package='example'\\nkept='2'\\nold.version='1'\",","+        \"[dependencies.old]\\npackage='example'\\nversion='1'\\n[dependencies.kept]\\nversion='2'\",","+        \"dependencies={old={package='example',version='1'},kept='2'}\",","+        \"target={cfg={dependencies={old={package='example',version='1'},kept='2'}}}\",","+    ] {","+        std::fs::write(&path, source).unwrap();","+        let names = BTreeSet::from([\"example\".to_owned()]);","+        let mut removed = BTreeSet::new();","+        remove_dependencies(&path, &names, None, &mut removed).unwrap();","+        assert_eq!(removed, names);","+        let updated = std::fs::read_to_string(&path).unwrap();","+        assert!(updated.contains(\"kept\"), \"{updated}\");","+        assert!(!updated.contains(\"old\"), \"{updated}\");","+    }","+}","+","+#[test]","+fn removing_optional_dependency_prunes_only_its_feature_references() {","+    let root = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();","+    let path = root.path().join(\"Cargo.toml\");","+    std::fs::write(&path, \"[dependencies]\\nold = { package = 'example', version = '1', optional = true }\\n[features]\\nold = []\\npublic = ['dep:old', 'old?/derive', 'old/derive', 'old']\\n\").unwrap();","+    remove_dependencies(","+        &path,","+        &BTreeSet::from([\"example\".to_string()]),","+        None,","+        &mut BTreeSet::new(),","+    )","+    .unwrap();","+    let manifest: toml::Table = toml::from_str(&std::fs::read_to_string(path).unwrap()).unwrap();","+    assert_eq!(","+        manifest[\"features\"][\"public\"].as_array().unwrap(),","+        &[toml::Value::String(\"old\".into())],","+    );","+}"],"additions":43,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/ecosystem_deps.rs","lines":["@@ -51,8 +51,6 @@ use python::{","     validate_explicit_python_requests,"," };"," use selectors::{","-    is_cargo_prefixed,","-    is_python_prefixed,","     parse_update_selectors,","     updates_all_except_exclusions,"," };","@@ -67,6 +65,8 @@ use std::{"," "," pub(crate) struct EcosystemUpdateStepOptions<'a> {","     pub(crate) selectors: &'a [String],","+    pub(crate) requests_validated: bool,","+    pub(crate) bare_names: selectors::BareUpdateNames,","     pub(crate) include_groups: &'a [DependencyGroup],","     pub(cr